  "body": "### What is the issue with the Cookie Store API Standard?\n\nAs part of #274 we added this note because Chrome currently exposes more information about cookies than is allowed:\n\n> Note: One implementation is known to expose information beyond _name_ and _value_.\n\nAs we normally don't have such notes in a specification I'm filing this issue to track eventual removal.",
